  "body": "Tucked well off the road down a private driveway, this character-filled, single-level home offers a peaceful, sunny retreat in a prime Bays pocket. With the vendor's next move fully secured in a retirement village, this much-loved property is genuinely here to sell and ready for its next owner to move straight in or add their own flair at their own pace.\r\n\r\nWhat You'll Love\r\n- Single-level layout featuring light-filled living that opens through French doors straight onto a sun-drenched deck\r\n- North-facing orientation filling the home with natural light and capturing all-day sun\r\n- Modernised bathroom already updated\r\n- Three bedrooms with functional proportions and built-in storage through-out\r\n- Kitchen and dining area with potential to open up or modernise if and when you choose\r\n- Useful garage supported by extensive off-street parking\r\n- Big grassed front section with plenty of room to park a boat, motorhome, or extra vehicles\r\n\r\nBest Bits From the Vendor\r\n\"I moved to Torbay 38 years ago when it was a smallish suburb on the outskirts of the East Coast Bays, and it was then, as it is now, just a brilliant place to live. Having the local schools, Torbay shops, and the beaches so close by has made daily life so easy. What I've loved most about 68A is the quietness and total solitude when you want to retreat, but you still feel part of a great neighbourhood with lovely people and good vibes. I haven't lost the love for living here at all, it's just time for me to scale down to a smaller home that fits my needs now.\"\r\n\r\nLifestyle & Location\r\nGlenvar Road sits right on the edge of the best coastal spots on the North Shore. You can walk to local bus stops and school routes, while Long Bay Village, Torbay shops, and Long Bay Beach are all just a couple of minutes away. It flies under the radar for convenience, giving you quiet, tucked-away living while keeping coastal walks, local schools, and morning coffees right at your fingertips.\r\n\r\nA grounded, honest home offering an affordable entry into the Bays with genuine scope to personalize down the track. With the vendor committed to their next step, this is an opportunity that deserves a look.\r\n\r\nCV: $790,000\r\n\r\nWatch 'The Reel Open Home' - https://youtube.com/shorts/kthGXSXOoes\r\n\r\n*Floor area and land area sourced from Auckland Council records.\r\nAgents happy to work in with your buyers.",
